# See https://docs.github.com/en/get-started/getting-started-with-git/ignoring-files for more about ignoring files.

# compiled output
dist
tmp
out-tsc
*.tsbuildinfo
.expo
.expo-shared

# electron-builder packaged app output (apps/khameleon-shell)
/apps/khameleon-shell/release

# Tesseract.js OCR trained-data (Cross-App Control, khameleon-decisions-log.md,
# 2026-10-03) - cached to ~/.khameleon/ocr-cache at runtime; this only catches
# it if cachePath is ever accidentally left at its cwd-relative default.
*.traineddata

